0..74 Comment "// What a rose tree refuses. A family nested in another family\'s arguments"
75..147 Comment "// stands below its node only through a parameter the other family holds"
148..217 Comment "// strictly positively, as `List` holds its elements; a parameter its"
218..295 Comment "// family consumes, standing to the left of an arrow in its own field, places"
296..375 Comment "// nothing below the node, and a node over it is a nested occurrence. A measure"
376..447 Comment "// through a list\'s map takes its children at their stage, and the node"
448..524 Comment "// itself at none: handed to `map` in a list of its own, it is not below the"
525..584 Comment "// node\'s stage. Shared with `../../model/data/rose.gandr`."
585..587 Comment "//"
588..621 Comment "// - see: #517 — `Rose`, `Bush`"
622..649 Comment "// - see: #393 — `forged`"
